User approved all three funder headline periods and MP similarity. Caller usage is DeclaredTotalsAggregate::new(year), observe each MemberDeclaration once, then totals(). Member currencies/counts use its historical aggregate. Funder passes only repository-filtered matching declarations and keeps its currency/party/recipient loop.

Alternative A shares one private stateful three-period aggregate using the existing PeriodAggregate. B is a pure iterator helper plus lightweight GBP accumulator and a second member aggregation pass. C rejects generic period collections in favor of fixed fields. Prefer A to preserve existing monetary rule ownership and one member traversal. The category-map overhead already exists for MP periods and does not warrant another accumulator representation in this feature.

DeclaredGbpTotals and CalendarYear remain the canonical public domain types. Add declared_totals and nullable first_registered_at to FunderDetails. summarize_funder takes CalendarYear selected once by the service. Canonical period classification remains in DeclaredTotalsAggregate. HTTP From<DeclaredGbpTotals> is shared; parser declaredTotals reused as a mandatory funder field.

Feature DeclaredTotals.svelte owns identical three-Metric rendering, exact formatting, count-zero/amount-null/zero distinction, title for incomplete periods, historical date suffix and desktop row. Extract current MP markup/styles and use it in both identities. Keep domain-aware formatting outside lib/ui and preserve member layout/copy. Names may become neutral declared-totals/declared-values with corresponding feature test locator updates. Funder uses teal already inherited. No new helper copy, subtitles or badges.

Invariants: count each matching source declaration once and sum every matching occurrence including duplicates. All categories included. UTC year selection and term boundary 2024-07-09T00:00:00Z. Undated historical only. Exact GBP BigDecimal/string, no conversion or JS Number. Missing GBP/unknown currency incomplete; known foreign excluded without incomplete. Declared labels replace Total funded, reflecting declaration records rather than earnings. No database or repository changes.

